			"date": "2026-02-10T16:39:15.345Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fosstodon.org/@krinkle\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>krinkle</span></a></span> 7,813 results for JavaScript 😅</p>",
